    "# About AIAIA\n\nAIAIA is a community organisation, and the AIAIA Youth App is how its members, officers and branches stay connected. This page is a placeholder draft.\n\n## What the app does\n\n- Lets members join their branch and keep their profile and digital ID in one place.\n- Shares announcements and events from the national and branch teams.\n- Handles dues, event fees and donations, with receipts.\n- Keeps a private gallery and documents library for members.\n\n## Who it is for\n\n- Youth wing: members under 35.\n- AIAIA: members aged 35 and above.\n- Dependents: children and young people managed by a parent or guardian until they turn 18.\n\n## Our commitments\n\n- Member data is kept in India, and is visible only to the people who need it.\n- Children's data is protected. A minor's phone number and date of birth are never shown to other members; only AIAIA officers and the child's guardian can see them.\n- The app is open source. The code is public, and member data never is.\n\n[TO BE PROVIDED BY AIAIA: a short description of the organisation, its mission and its history.]\n",
